flowchart LR
  Request[Ticket detail request] --> Access{Own ticket or viewAllTickets?}
  Access -->|No| Deny[404 - ticket not found]
  Access -->|Yes| Notes{useInternalNotes?}
  Notes -->|Yes| Full[Query public replies and internal notes]
  Notes -->|No| Public[Query public replies only]
  Full --> Response[Server response]
  Public --> Response
